{"1307150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MLF: Pro Catch", "steam_appid": 1307150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4850860], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hook, fight, and land your catch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or online with friends. Cast your line, and wait. Watch the water, stay ready... and then - STRIKE! The fight is on. From here it's down to you. Control the drag, manage the line tension, and read the fish as it runs, dives, and tries to throw the hook. Land it, and the catch is yours. Lose it, and it's one that got away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b69a3dd78e5f40ebf46b60446c65964b.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b69a3dd78e5f40ebf46b60446c65964b.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b69a3dd78e5f40ebf46b60446c65964b.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 50 fish species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features more than 50 fish species, including Largemouth bass, Rainbow trout, Muskellunge, Channel catfish, Alligator gar, sharks, and more! Each one has its own model, habitat, and behavior, so the fish you find depend on where and how you fish. Track your catches, log your records, and work toward your personal-best trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/8eafac2bd1eca0b9507267c2b069b489.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/8eafac2bd1eca0b9507267c2b069b489.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/8eafac2bd1eca0b9507267c2b069b489.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different waters to explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish across Shadow Lake, Rock Creek Bay, the Everglades, the Florida Keys, Sturgeon Bay, and Lake Whitney, each with its own environment and fish populations.  Each holds its own species and its own spots worth finding, and with a full day-night cycle and shifting weather, conditions are never quite the same from one trip to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/456f07a04392177a25d1dc00d656a51d.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/456f07a04392177a25d1dc00d656a51d.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/456f07a04392177a25d1dc00d656a51d.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish on your own at your own pace, or head online and share the water with friends. Cast side by side, swap your best catches, and trade tips for a relaxed day out together - or turn it into a friendly contest to see who can land the biggest fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d078663bdaab8437902cf34a01a14946.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d078663bdaab8437902cf34a01a14946.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d078663bdaab8437902cf34a01a14946.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear and tackle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the in-game store and equip your angler with gear from real brands, including Mossy Oak®, YETI®, Abu Garcia®, Fenwick®, Hardy®, Pflueger®, Greys®, Berkley®, Duckett Fishing®, Lew's®, Strike King®, Zebco® and more. Choose rods, reels, baits and tackle to suit the fish you're after, and upgrade your setup as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d9382cf78b0c4fa991a2c6402ff3770c.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d9382cf78b0c4fa991a2c6402ff3770c.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d9382cf78b0c4fa991a2c6402ff3770c.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fish from shore or boat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish on foot along the shoreline, cast from the docks and piers, or take a boat out to reach deeper water and troll as you go. Different spots and methods suit different fish, so every trip is yours to approach however you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/a9dfc4d82b5beb3d8788f93e0284b084.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/a9dfc4d82b5beb3d8788f93e0284b084.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/a9dfc4d82b5beb3d8788f93e0284b084.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete on the leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in tournaments and climb the leaderboards to see where you rank. Compete for in-game rewards as you go, and keep an eye out for official events and tournaments, each with various prizes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFFICIAL PARTNERS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5980014a3a72af530c5488c3a43d5b30.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hook, fight, and land your catch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or online with friends. Cast your line, and wait. Watch the water, stay ready... and then - STRIKE! The fight is on. From here it's down to you. Control the drag, manage the line tension, and read the fish as it runs, dives, and tries to throw the hook. Land it, and the catch is yours. Lose it, and it's one that got away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b69a3dd78e5f40ebf46b60446c65964b.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b69a3dd78e5f40ebf46b60446c65964b.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b69a3dd78e5f40ebf46b60446c65964b.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 50 fish species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features more than 50 fish species, including Largemouth bass, Rainbow trout, Muskellunge, Channel catfish, Alligator gar, sharks, and more! Each one has its own model, habitat, and behavior, so the fish you find depend on where and how you fish. Track your catches, log your records, and work toward your personal-best trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/8eafac2bd1eca0b9507267c2b069b489.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/8eafac2bd1eca0b9507267c2b069b489.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/8eafac2bd1eca0b9507267c2b069b489.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different waters to explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish across Shadow Lake, Rock Creek Bay, the Everglades, the Florida Keys, Sturgeon Bay, and Lake Whitney, each with its own environment and fish populations.  Each holds its own species and its own spots worth finding, and with a full day-night cycle and shifting weather, conditions are never quite the same from one trip to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/456f07a04392177a25d1dc00d656a51d.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/456f07a04392177a25d1dc00d656a51d.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/456f07a04392177a25d1dc00d656a51d.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish on your own at your own pace, or head online and share the water with friends. Cast side by side, swap your best catches, and trade tips for a relaxed day out together - or turn it into a friendly contest to see who can land the biggest fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d078663bdaab8437902cf34a01a14946.poster.avif?t=1787643258\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d078663bdaab8437902cf34a01a14946.webm?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/d078663bdaab8437902cf34a01a14946.mp4?t=1787643258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear and tackle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the in-game store and equip your angler with gear from real brands, including Mossy Oak®, YETI®, Abu Garcia®, Fenwick®, Hardy®, Pflueger®, Greys®, Berkley®, Duckett Fishing®, Lew's®, Strike King®, Zebco® and more. Choose rods, reels, baits and tackle to suit the fish you're after, and upgrade your setup as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_